  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>The grooming salon at 8 avenue de la République, in the east of Nice, is now part of the Nice brand Dog's Land. Its official website (dogsland.fr) presents it as its "grooming salon and concierge" at this address, with the same number as the former Au Paradis Canin salon (09 83 62 18 33), and still links to the "auparadiscanin06" Facebook page. Dog's Land has another salon on rue Acchiardi-de-Saint-Léger, as well as a fitness centre by appointment. In the local press, Nice-Presse (May 2024) presents the brand as based in the Saint-Roch district since 1990, with its two grooming salons, a concierge service and a care centre.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>According to the Dog's Land website, this salon is open Tuesday to Saturday, from 9am to 12pm and from 2pm to 6pm. Call 09 83 62 18 33 to book and to ask about prices, which are not published on the website.</p>
      <p>The salon takes care of dogs, cats and small pets of all breeds and sizes; the brand says it adapts its service to disabled dogs or dogs with behavioural problems. Its grooming page presents "creative grooming", with techniques imported from the United States and Japan, from bathing to clipping, scissor cutting or stripping, including for large dogs or show dogs. A de-matting supplement applies to dogs and cats with badly tangled coats, and nail clipping is listed at 10 € for dogs; other prices are "on request by phone". The PagesJaunes directory page (relayed by Mappy) also mentions dog colouring, trimming and a self-service wash, which the official website does not detail: ask the salon about them.</p>
      <p>From 2022 to 2025, the brand ran a charity campaign (1 € donated per grooming); the website says this operation is over. The salon on rue Acchiardi-de-Saint-Léger (15 rue, 04 93 56 25 21) is open Monday to Friday at the same hours; the neighbouring fitness centre only takes appointments.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if you are looking for "Au Paradis Canin", this is it, under the Dog's Land name.</div>
    </div>

